LibraryType:
  Guid: 74b4258c-b8d4-49f6-a803-02eb0ff105eb
  Comment:
    en-US: |-
      The function is used for processing (scaling) an analog process value to another process value of a different range.  
      Converts it from one to another meaningful unit, e.g. $[rpm]$ to $[m/s]$, $[°C]$ to $[°F]$.
LibraryVersion:
  VersionNumber: 3.0.0
  Author: Siemens Digital Industry
  IsDefault: true
